    45	\begin{abstract}
    46	Working in subsystems of second order arithmetic, we formulate several representations
    47	for hypergraphs.  We then prove the equivalence of various vertex coloring theorems to
    48	$\wkl$, $\aca$, and $\poo$.  MSC: 03B30; 03F35
